  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmarvvinekk.crevado.com%252fwork-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dorpGu2.png\" width=\"1070\" height=\"205\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/marvvinekk/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C59daLc.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fMarvvinekk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bjYhvcf.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>鏟子擴充！</strong></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">一款對原版友好的 Forge 模組，為您的遊戲增添鏟子工具，並讓您可以挖掘 <strong>3x3x1</strong> 範圍的地面方塊<strong>。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kR4NFMT.png\" width=\"1864\" height=\"910\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">本模組為您帶來&nbsp;<strong>鏟子</strong> 與 <strong>強化鏟子</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">這兩種工具都能以 <strong>3x3x1</strong> 的範圍挖掘地面，效率遠超普通鏟子。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>強化鏟子</strong>不僅比鏟子更耐用，效率也更高！<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">有什麼代價嗎？它們需要更多材料來製作，並且需要一根 <strong>強化木棍</strong>。<br></span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">所有合成表請見下方！</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">震波擴散 - 5x5x1</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">使用 <strong>震波擴散附魔</strong> 升級您的工具，以 <strong>5x5x1</strong> 的範圍挖掘更多地面！<br>此附魔可在寶藏箱、附魔台、各種戰利品表中獲得，或向村民交易取得。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">合成表：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qxujsdw.png\"></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4oL0TRj.png\"></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WIgS8Gl.png\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">加入我的伺服器 <strong>Squid Abyss</strong>，提出問題、建議新的實用性（QoL）模組或功能，並幫助決定接下來要開發什麼內容！<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/tP9PZvUNjW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IxYbJ3j.png\" width=\"918\" height=\"275\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4E36BTAWS3HUN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZaUBPD5.png\" width=\"940\" height=\"190\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果您希望將此模組用於整合包中，歡迎自由使用！</p>\n</div>",
